Package: psychrmslab
Type: Package
Title: R Package Companion to PSYCH 350 at University of Nebraska-Lincoln
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026
Authors@R: as.person(c(
    "Emma Marshall <em.marshall47@gmail.com> [aut, cre]"
  ))
Description: A collection of statistical analysis and APA-style reporting functions 
    designed for behavioral science courses. Includes functions for correlations, 
    chi-square tests, between- and within-groups ANOVA, factorial ANOVA, and 
    multiple regression, along with APA-formatted tables, write-ups, and 
    interactive worksheet checkers. Includes a built-in Superman media dataset 
    for demonstrations.
